# SEO Metrics MCP — provider API keys. Copy to .env and fill in. Never commit .env.

# Open PageRank (now hosted by Keywords Everywhere) — https://openpagerank.keywordseverywhere.com/docs
# Token starts with opr_live_. Free tier, no card. Powers the domain authority score (0-10).
OPR_API_KEY=

# Ahrefs API v3 — https://docs.ahrefs.com  (Account → API). Sent as: Authorization: Bearer <key>.
# API access is a paid add-on; if calls return Unauthorized, the plan does not include API or the key is stale.
AHREFS_API_KEY=

# Keywords Everywhere — https://api.keywordseverywhere.com/docs/  (Account → API). Sent as: Authorization: Bearer <key>.
# Credit-metered: get_keyword_data spends credits per keyword; a 402 means the account is out of credits.
KEYWORDS_EVERYWHERE_API_KEY=
